Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.13,0:00:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～ 呜……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.49,0:00:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（仁）没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的心 对我来说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.03,0:00:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像拿在手里一样看得一清二楚。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 让我看看你的力量……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.63,0:00:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那令人憎恶的 No.之力……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.49,0:00:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜…… 可恶……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 No.16！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冲击统治者！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.46,0:00:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.22,0:00:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…… 你到底是……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾名乃 仁。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:00:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.猎人快斗大人忠实的仆从。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的灵魂 就由我收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…… 啊啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.64,0:01:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）一飞冲天吧 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.92,0:01:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天可没迟到哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.21,0:01:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿！用新卡强化过的这套卡组{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.58,0:01:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定要把快斗那家伙狠狠复仇回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.61,0:01:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？怎么一脸阴沉啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.33,0:01:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）我没法乐观起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你和我是不一样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.89,0:01:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊？你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.26,0:01:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那不是理所当然的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.36,0:01:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦，早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:02:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么早上好啊给我过来一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.15,0:02:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天可不一样你得给我好好说清楚。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.34,0:02:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么啊，突然这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.53,0:02:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？这是什么东西！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.23,0:02:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）我在网上找到的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最近决斗者接连遭到袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.14,0:02:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的事件正在发生。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.80,0:02:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）而且那些受害者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好像全都持有 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.02,0:02:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.21,0:02:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说再这样下去游马也会{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.73,0:02:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}像他们那样遭遇不测不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.10,0:02:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.69,0:02:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来还有这种事件啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我完全不知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别糊弄我！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.10,0:02:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说实话。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡是不是很危险的东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我、我真的不知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.73,0:02:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.25,0:02:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…我、我去下厕所！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，为什么不把真相说出来？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:02:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这还用说吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么能把那帮家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.19,0:03:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卷进和快斗的战斗里啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗那家伙，好像
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又在狩猎 No.卡了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.41,0:03:19.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我们就主动去找他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把 No.卡夺回来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.78,0:03:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭这种天真的想法就能赢的话，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.51,0:03:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他也就不会那么难对付了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.49,0:03:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯…你该不会是怕了快斗吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怕他怎么能行啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.22,0:03:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要找回记忆的话，就得赢过快斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能去收集 No.卡了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.77,0:03:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是输了会怎样！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.29,0:03:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的灵魂会被夺走 我也会从这个世界上消失啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种丧气话别说了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.71,0:03:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）早 早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.89,0:03:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！？ 早 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个… 小猫咪。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还记得我？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.62,0:03:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 嘿嘿嘿…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个 快斗是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊哈哈～！ 糟了 要漏出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了去厕所了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗？ No.卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人 这就是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全新 No.卡的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.27,0:05:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是被快斗大人选中之人。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了您我愿献上此身的一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我能看见。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.03,0:06:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迷途的羔羊……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.29,0:06:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得到下一张 No.卡的人我能看见……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.19,0:06:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（门铃）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小飒～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.64,0:06:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.64,0:06:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉 奶奶让我去跑腿 先走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.68,0:06:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的！又让他跑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟我们有个好主意。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.俱乐部？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.61,0:06:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用我们的力量来调查 No.卡的秘密。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.82,0:06:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底如果游马君不肯说的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.52,0:06:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就由我们来解开谜团。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.87,0:06:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）好像很有趣乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.90,0:06:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿！Numbers Club
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.52,0:06:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也加入你们也行乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.95,0:06:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助…说起来 你也
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:07:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}曾经拥有过Numbers对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.87,0:07:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毫不隐瞒地说 拥有Numbers
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.37,0:07:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候的记忆是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.24,0:07:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记忆是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.43,0:07:13.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什～么都不记得了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.12,0:07:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.13,0:07:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也想加入Numbers Club。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.69,0:07:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男他们）呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.71,0:07:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 看到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马一个人在和谁说话。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是 星光体吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.11,0:07:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说了些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Numbers之类的 打倒快斗之类的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗？谁啊？那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定和事件有什么关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.73,0:07:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.31,0:07:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家一起去找线索吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们五个，No.俱乐部第一次出任务哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.32,0:07:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）上吧，噢——！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.01,0:07:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《要是能搞懂 No.的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马就会愿意看我了吧》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.72,0:07:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以，拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:07:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（猫咪们）喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我啊，说到底就是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在逻辑上没法接受的东西最讨厌了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.99,0:08:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定要把 No.的事查个水落石出》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「把 No.给 弄清楚的话」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「会变成什么样呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.61,0:08:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「说了吧　对说了吧在干这种事的蝉」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.87,0:08:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）关于 No.卡你在调查吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.97,0:08:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……　那个　请告诉我。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.35,0:08:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡对你们来说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不　就连我也不是能运用自如的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么意思……　是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别和 No.卡扯上关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.34,0:09:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）什么都没有……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.03,0:09:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也完全没头绪。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.23,0:09:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底就是毫无线索　的意思吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.27,0:09:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唉——。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘻嘻嘻嘻！　太天真了里！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.14,0:09:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}情报怎么可能在表世界遍地都是乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都跟我来乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.97,0:09:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来带路乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是里世界里传闻百发百中的占卜师之馆乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.97,0:09:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}占卜？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.15,0:09:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}关于Numbers的事，一定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也能帮我们看穿的乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底这不就是全交给别人了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.59,0:09:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恭候多时了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.78,0:09:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是命运将你们引到了这座馆里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迷茫的羔羊们啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我用力量，为你们授予正确的指引吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.03,0:10:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那、那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我都看见了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们是想调查某样东西对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.45,0:10:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.82,0:10:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们所寻求的东西 那就是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.21,0:10:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}方形的… 没错 非常薄…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 卡呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.95,0:10:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 还不是普通的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隐藏着某种不得了的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.52,0:10:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡的名字是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.37,0:11:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗怪兽的… No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗 骗人的吧！？ No.卡这事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可一个字都没说过啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 是不是有什么内幕！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.97,0:11:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说什么内幕啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}占卜是没有内幕的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.67,0:11:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个… No.卡到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.65,0:11:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.89,0:11:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所谓 No.，乃是邪恶之物。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}邪恶？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.43,0:11:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持有它的人会被 No.侵蚀内心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.46,0:11:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最终连灵魂都会被夺走。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.84,0:11:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他……灵魂……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.90,0:11:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？游马是？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……我的朋友游马因为 No.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可能在做危险的事情。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.69,0:11:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我想知道 No.的秘密。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.56,0:11:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.74,0:11:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你愿意告诉我这些，真是太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我担心游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:12:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的朋友竟然是 No.的持有者。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这正是命运的指引。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂、喂，小鸟……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.89,0:12:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们就请你们成为祭品吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.01,0:12:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（3人）呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.77,0:12:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.99,0:12:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唉……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又叹气了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天都第几次了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.06,0:12:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唉……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.05,0:12:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.69,0:12:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次再叹气就罚款了哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！ 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家…… 大家都！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了啊 到底 发生什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟她…… 大家都…… 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 喂 小猫！ 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有 No.卡的人啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？ 这 这个声音是……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.63,0:13:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾名乃 真洞悉一切之人。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.84,0:13:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人忠实的仆人。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.73,0:13:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马啊，你的朋友我收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我的公馆里，以 No.卡为赌注
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.31,0:13:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}否则的话，他们的性命就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.35,0:13:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游、游马！我到底……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.75,0:13:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫，带路吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯，知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.63,0:13:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等。这是个陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}她是为了把我们引过去{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.02,0:13:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才被放出来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.86,0:13:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是陷阱又怎么了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.23,0:13:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你怕什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.83,0:13:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么能丢下小鸟她们不管！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是，你能赢过快斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.29,0:13:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.14,0:13:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他的战略 他的力量……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.18,0:14:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在那场决斗中亲身领教过了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.21,0:14:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的我们 没有获胜的把握。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.24,0:14:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那你 是打算只跟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.75,0:14:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}百分之百能赢的家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.94,0:14:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才决斗吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.30,0:14:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗对我来说就是生存的意义本身。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.51,0:14:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟明知道会输的对手去战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是愚蠢的行为。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.78,0:14:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.89,0:14:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很遗憾 你朋友的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.13,0:14:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来只能放弃了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.32,0:14:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.18,0:14:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了…… 你的心情好～明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁要借你的力量啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.48,0:14:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底这里是哪儿啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.67,0:14:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救命啊乌啦啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.19,0:14:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家，撑住！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.89,0:14:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧，游马！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.77,0:15:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.13,0:15:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！那是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欢迎你，游马君持有 No.卡的人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这声音是…你这家伙，把小鸟她们给我还回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵…想救你的朋友的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.56,0:15:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就和我决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.21,0:15:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在快斗大人面前。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.77,0:15:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快、快斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.24,0:15:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人 我要从这家伙手里夺走 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.96,0:15:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}献给快斗大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.63,0:15:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我来猎取吧 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正合我意！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.40,0:15:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对会赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:16:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会救大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！ D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目标 锁定！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.65,0:16:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.85,0:16:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻归我了我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 橙之萨满。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.99,0:16:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.35,0:16:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《攻击力 零的怪兽！》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖放1张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.27,0:16:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 隆隆隆石人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.50,0:16:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轰轰轰～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:17:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样 这家伙的攻击要是打中的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一击就能造成大伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.24,0:17:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 我发动橙之萨满的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.78,0:17:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方召唤效果怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.31,0:17:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌把名字带有萨满的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.36,0:17:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我身边现身吧 红之萨满！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.94,0:17:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.29,0:17:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是 攻击力 零…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.26,0:17:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要小心啊 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊 攻击力零的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.93,0:17:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正是造成大伤害的好机会！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 轰轰轰魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.23,0:17:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轰轰 轰轰～轰～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.93,0:17:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 陷阱卡 打开 守护神之舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 选择对方的1张手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.34,0:17:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡是怪兽卡的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.55,0:17:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.22,0:17:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，能看到一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又不是超能力者那种事怎么可能做得到！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.95,0:17:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！小心点！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.30,0:18:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的手牌是5张。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其中怪兽卡只有1张。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡是从右数第2张！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.23,0:18:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.94,0:18:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗡～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.93,0:18:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗡～！嗡嗡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.97,0:18:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此时，由于守护神之舞的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.69,0:18:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将选中的卡送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.85,0:18:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且还能抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.87,0:18:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师被送去墓地了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.23,0:18:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙真的能看见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.26,0:18:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《从手牌中仅凭1张
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.79,0:18:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就看穿了怪兽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然这个男人，足以与快斗匹敌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是拥有这种力量的人吗？》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.59,0:18:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶，这样下去的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.12,0:18:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，要守住啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.16,0:18:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用手牌里的陷阱卡巩固防守。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.99,0:18:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，现在也只能这样了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.89,0:19:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡，召唤术士。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己场上有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.15,0:19:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力为零的魔法师族怪兽两只的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.69,0:19:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从卡组将一只等级4以下的术士
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我特殊召唤绿术士。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈哈哈。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.81,0:19:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是你不断召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力为零的怪兽的理由。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着吧我 No.卡的伟大力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.91,0:19:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级4的橙之萨满
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}红之萨满 绿之萨满进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.00,0:19:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.51,0:19:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤 现身吧 No.16。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}色之支配者。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.72,0:20:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冲击统治者。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.09,0:20:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是那家伙的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动冲击统治者的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.64,0:20:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.51,0:20:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宣言1种卡的种类
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.42,0:20:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到对方第2个回合的结束阶段{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将该卡的效果无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把效果无效……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.93,0:20:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.17,0:20:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 我所看破的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.47,0:20:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在2个回合内 将无法使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.32,0:20:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我能看见。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.28,0:20:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你盖放的那张卡的种类……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.38,0:20:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你盖下的是陷阱卡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.59,0:20:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.02,0:20:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来　你就失去了防御攻击的手段。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.21,0:20:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈哈哈哈……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用冲击统治者　攻击轰轰魔像。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.35,0:21:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.41,0:21:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你朋友们的命和你的生命值直接相连。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.99,0:21:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你一旦败北岩石就会　全部碎裂{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.85,0:21:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们就会　被扔进岩浆之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧　在我力量面前在快斗大人面前俯首称臣吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.63,0:21:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我连你的灵魂一起猎取吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.88,0:21:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，银河眼光子龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.47,0:21:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束了，这样一来…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.37,0:22:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《原来如此，我……在害怕快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是名为恐惧的感情吗…》
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.01,0:22:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.88,0:22:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）本周的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.40,0:22:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用完毕的魔法卡是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.26,0:22:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.40,0:22:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是回到手牌？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.33,0:24:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是，送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.03,0:24:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和魔法卡一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.22,0:24:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡使用完毕后
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.40,0:24:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也会被送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.10,0:24:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家，都记住哦。

